+/*######
+## npc_zelda_portal_mage - Archmage Elandra (Stormwind's Wizard's Sanctum, 190670) sends the hero to
+## the Kirin Tor camp outside Dalaran; Magister Aldwyn there (190671) sends the hero back to Stormwind
+######*/
